        <activityName xml:lang="en">Uranium natural, in yellowcake, at mill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium natural, in yellowcake, at mill
PSI data (BFE project 407, Christian Bauer, April 2012).;
UUID: 3a63e776-d32f-3013-bae4-9f24cb581ec0
The module includes: the land use for the operation (mostly tailings); diesel generators and  industrial boilers burning light oil; transport of the chemicals and fuels; radioactive and non-radioactive emissions to air and water during operation; water use (mining water, but attributed to "unspecified natural origin").
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Since commercial production began only in 2001, one can assume the facilities to be modern
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from Caetite 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3a63e776-d32f-3013-bae4-9f24cb581ec0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
